[
  {
    "start": 0.325,
    "end": 1.55,
    "text": "Your tooth hurts."
  },
  {
    "start": 1.55,
    "end": 3.825,
    "text": "It is fourteen thousand years ago."
  },
  {
    "start": 3.825,
    "end": 6.2375,
    "text": "There is no dental clinic down the road."
  },
  {
    "start": 6.2375,
    "end": 8.475,
    "text": "So did people simply do nothing?"
  },
  {
    "start": 9.25,
    "end": 10.45,
    "text": "Not always."
  },
  {
    "start": 10.45,
    "end": 12.55,
    "text": "At Villabruna, in northern Italy,"
  },
  {
    "start": 12.55,
    "end": 14.5875,
    "text": "researchers studied a human molar with a"
  },
  {
    "start": 14.5875,
    "end": 15.6,
    "text": "cavity."
  },
  {
    "start": 15.6,
    "end": 18.125,
    "text": "Inside it, they found tiny scratches and"
  },
  {
    "start": 18.125,
    "end": 19.4,
    "text": "chipped enamel."
  },
  {
    "start": 20.150000000000002,
    "end": 22.3875,
    "text": "Experiments suggested that pointed flint"
  },
  {
    "start": 22.3875,
    "end": 24.2875,
    "text": "tools had scraped the cavity while the"
  },
  {
    "start": 24.2875,
    "end": 25.975,
    "text": "person was alive."
  },
  {
    "start": 25.975,
    "end": 28.4125,
    "text": "Think careful scraping, not a modern"
  },
  {
    "start": 28.4125,
    "end": 29.85,
    "text": "dentist's drill."
  },
  {
    "start": 30.600000000000005,
    "end": 32.6625,
    "text": "That is evidence of an attempt to treat a"
  },
  {
    "start": 32.6625,
    "end": 34.075,
    "text": "damaged tooth."
  },
  {
    "start": 34.075,
    "end": 36.550000000000004,
    "text": "It does not tell us exactly how it felt,"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.550000000000004,
    "end": 38.475,
    "text": "who helped, or whether the treatment"
  },
  {
    "start": 38.475,
    "end": 39.325,
    "text": "worked."
  },
  {
    "start": 40.050000000000004,
    "end": 41.875,
    "text": "The person holding their cheek here is"
  },
  {
    "start": 41.875,
    "end": 42.975,
    "text": "imaginary."
  },
  {
    "start": 42.975,
    "end": 44.85,
    "text": "The ancient tooth is real."
  },
  {
    "start": 44.85,
    "end": 47.5,
    "text": "Our ancestors had serious skills."
  },
  {
    "start": 47.5,
    "end": 49.875,
    "text": "I would still rather book an appointment."
  }
]